    "detailed_description": "<br><br>Cat Tower is a horror-themed turn-based RPG with a lot of focus on character building. The game is set in a small brazillian city that is in verge of collapsing after an ominous tower appears beside it overnight.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A wide array of different spell cards to suit different strategies and styles of play.<br></li><li>Several talents with effects that range from slight advantages to effects that can fuck over everyone including yourself.<br></li><li>Six basic attributes that can help you either complement your play or cover your weaknesses.<br></li><li>Various different allies, all of which can be strengthened and upgraded.<br></li><li>Free ability to reset your entire character at any point in the game.<br></li><li>Banger ass soundtrack</li></ul>",
